WEBVTT

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.570
It's been such a long time.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:17.440
Long time no see;

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.080
I heard about Hyeonsoo.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.120
I read about you from time to time in the newspaper.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:24.790
I really enjoyed your performance.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:26.790
Thank you.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:29.150
Thank you for your hard work today, Producer Kim.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.130
Yes, same to you, Mrs. Kang.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.530
I was wondering

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:35.630
if you wouldn't mind featuring in our program one more time?

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:38.720
I'll go on ahead; you two talk things over.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:39.810
Yes, Mrs. Jung.

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:46.310
How do you know that person?

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:48.550
She's Yujin's mother.

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:49.610
You know who Yujin is, don't you?

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:51.650
Yujin Jung?

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:58.410
<i>She's Yujin's mother?</i>

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:34.710
<i>I need you to do me a favor, Hyeoksoo.</i>

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:40.010
<i>Please give Yujin this letter if she ever asks about me.</i>

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.090
Darn it.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.640
Whatever.

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:50.270
Hey, Miss Yujin?

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:55.650
Here you go.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:00.850
And now I've delivered it.

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:01.780
Take care.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.490
What's with that guy?

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:08.370
We're late; they're all waiting for us.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:15.080
Look!

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:17.570
The lines on your left and right palms are different.

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:17.570
Really?

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:19.260
And look how long your "life line" is here!

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:19.910
Hey, guys.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.280
Hey, Sanghyuk!

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.050
You looked really cool out there.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:23.870
Nah.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:27.350
No, that was such an amazing proposal!

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:28.770
I was so jealous.

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.310
Where's Yujin?

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:35.500
What's wrong, Chelin?

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.310
Did something happen?

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.450
Just answer my question.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:39.800
Where's Yujin?

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:40.820
She's inside, isn't she?

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:43.610
Hey, Chelin!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:51.790
You bitch.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:58.500
Did you tell Minhyung to break up with me?

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:01.500
Why are you still here?

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.180
Why didn't you just run away with Minhyung?

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:04.300
Chelin!

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:06.340
Hey, Chelin!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.010
Oh, it must be for Sanghyuk then.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.180
What's wrong with you?

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:11.060
Let's talk later.

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.230
Let go!

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.860
Why you?

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:17.230
Why do Joonsang and Minhyung both have to like <i>you?</i>

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.190
You've already got Sanghyuk, right?

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:22.690
Minhyung's all I have.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.320
He's everything I've got.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.990
So why did you have to...

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:31.640
No matter what you do, I won't give up on Minhyung.

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:32.540
I'll never give up.

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:36.000
It was enough that you stole Joonsang away from me in the first place!

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:44.090
What do you mean?

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:47.590
Mother.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:56.770
Mother, this is all a misunderstanding.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:04:59.810
Please, listen to what I have to say.

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:01.480
Out of my way.

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:02.570
Mother.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.930
I'll pretend that that conversation just now never happened.

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:35.100
Let me ask you this instead:

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:39.270
Do you love Sanghyuk?

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:42.400
What are you saying, Mother?

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.300
You stay quiet;

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:45.570
I'm asking Yujin.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.990
Do you really intend to marry my son?

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:49.950
What's wrong? Can't you answer?

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:50.820
Honey.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:54.910
It just seems to me that Yujin doesn't love Sanghyuk.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.370
What's that supposed to mean?

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.040
This is too much, Mrs. Kim.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.130
How could you say things like that?

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:08.130
You should be more concerned about why she can't answer the question.

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.640
Come on, Yujin, answer her.

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:17.480
Tell her that you love Sanghyuk and that you're going to marry him.

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.150
Come on, Yujin.

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:24.570
I...

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:30.320
I can't marry him.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:31.820
What?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.990
I can't.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:32.980
Yujin!

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.500
Yujin, what are you...

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.500
I'm sorry Mom, I can't get married.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:45.590
What is this girl...

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.300
Yujin!

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.340
Hey, Yujin!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.800
Yujin!

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:52.830
If things don't turn out right with Yujin,

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.180
I'll never look at you again, Mother.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:55.510
Hey, Sanghyuk!

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:58.430
Yujin!

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:12.360
Wait, Yujin!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.410
You can't leave like this;

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.830
go back and say that you're sorry, and that you made a mistake.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.000
Just go tell her. Okay, Yujin?

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:24.290
I can't.

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:29.510
I was serious.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.340
You were serious?

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.680
I'm sorry, Sanghyuk.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:02.120
Yujin...

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.690
I shouldn't have done that, Yujin.

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:08.840
I'm sorry, Yujin.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:13.510
Yujin!

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:19.640
Yujin...

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:21.350
Yujin!

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:41.290
You promised not to act like this, Chelin.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:43.960
What about Yujin?

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.210
Did you think I wouldn't notice?

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.920
You're with her right now, aren't you?

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:04.810
Miss Yujin, where are you right—

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:06.060
<i>Mr. Minhyung?</i>

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.560
<i>Where are you right now?</i>

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:08.350
<i>Are you—</i>

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:40.300
Hey, Yujin,

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:47.680
Yahoo~

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:49.520
What are you going to do when first snow comes?

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:50.800
What about you?

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:00.910
What are you doing here?

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.030
Meeting someone.

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:05.200
Let's meet here on New Year's Eve,

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.160
and I'll tell you.

00:10:57.840 --> 00:10:58.800
<i>"Hey, Yujin."</i>

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:04.600
<i>Is that how I used to address you?</i>

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.180
<i>"Hey, Yujin."</i>

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:09.890
<i>"Hey, Yujin..."</i>

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:15.440
<i>But I can't remember anything.</i>

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:19.150
<i>The Joonsang that you're longing for so much,</i>

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:22.820
<i>is both me and not me at the same time.</i>

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:26.830
<i>If I've lost the memories that we created together,</i>

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:33.330
<i>then "Joonsang" would be nothing more than an empty name.</i>

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:36.790
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.840
<i>No matter how much you call out for Joonsang,</i>

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:43.590
<i>I can't answer back.</i>

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.720
<i>I'm sorry, Miss Yujin.</i>

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:52.690
<i>I am grateful that you existed somewhere</i>

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:56.980
<i>within the past that I can no longer remember.</i>

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.650
<i>Sincerely.</i>

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:18.290
Hey, Yujin!

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:52.790
Is that you, Joonsang?

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:01.090
I...

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:03.920
I'm too late, aren't I?

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:08.180
Joonsang!

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:09.220
Yujin!

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:12.210
It's really you, right?

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:13.470
I'm not dreaming, am I?

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.390
Yujin...

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:25.320
I wanted to tell you that day...

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:27.400
Yujin,

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.280
I love you.

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:51.360
Hey, Sanghyuk!

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.600
I don't see any stars out tonight.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:11.780
Maybe it's because of the snow.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.200
I see one.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:15.570
Where?

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.380
You told me I should look for Polaris whenever I'm lost.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:38.930
Are you lost?

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:43.980
I've hurt a lot of people I care about today.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:48.440
They may not forgive me for it.

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:56.950
You'll always stay by my side, even if everyone else forsakes me, right?

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.740
Like Polaris.

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:11.670
You were the one who always remained steady like Polaris, not me.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:18.800
That's how I was able to find my way back after being lost.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:41.990
I'll call back later, Jinsook.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.910
All right, don't worry.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:53.840
Where shall we go?

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:56.510
To Chuncheon.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.510
My mom must be worried.

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:01.510
Are you ready?

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:04.680
Ready not to be hurt, that is.

00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:09.650
I was the one who hurt her.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:14.570
Let's go.

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:20.070
This, and this!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:24.700
Start everything again from scratch.

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:29.380
But we won't have enough time...

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:31.150
Don't you know it's better to not do something at all,

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:32.080
than to do it half-assed?

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:34.730
We still have time,

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:36.920
so stay up all night fixing it if you have to.

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.200
Chelin's gone berserk, Yongguk!

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.850
She's become a completely different person after being sick last night.

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:48.060
<i>Did Yujin call you by any chance?</i>

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:52.350
I talked to her just now, and she said she's stopping at home.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:53.360
In Seoul?

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:55.620
<i>No, back in Chuncheon;</i>

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:58.650
<i>she said she's going to be staying with her mother for a few days.</i>

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:03.000
<i>But she kept saying something weird;</i>

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.780
<i>she said that Mr. Minhyung is Joonsang.</i>

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.040
What the hell are you talking about?

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:14.500
Say it one more time, Jinsook.

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:18.920
<i>Like I said, Yujin said Mr. Minhyung is actually Joonsang.</i>

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:21.970
<i>I kept asking her again and again because I couldn't believe it either.</i>

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:22.800
No way!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:27.560
<i>She said Joonsang never died, and there was some sort of mistake.</i>

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:30.890
<i>I couldn't ask her more because I was so busy, but—</i>

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:33.690
Don't tell Chelin any of this, okay?

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:35.110
I'm hanging up; I have a patient.

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:36.310
<i>Hey, what are—</i>

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:40.900
You and your temper...

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.470
I have something to tell you as well.

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:01.090
I'll see you later at home.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:02.550
Your mother?

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:04.250
Yeah.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:08.140
I figured I should tell her that I regained my memories,

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:10.810
so I told her we should stay together in Chuncheon for a few days.

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:11.890
That's great.

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.140
I'll introduce you to her for real this time.

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:16.210
She may look cold on the outside, but she's a nice person.

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:18.020
She's just not good at expressing herself.

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.170
I know that.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:20.670
She really loves you.

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:22.990
I actually met her before.

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:23.650
When?

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:25.360
Back when you were asleep.

00:20:46.490 --> 00:20:47.340
Yujin?

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:49.100
Did you say something?

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:52.100
You said you still remember everything, right?

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.600
We're in Chuncheon now;

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:56.060
tell me about the kind of memories we created here.

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:01.980
There's not a lot to remember;

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:05.860
we'd always get into little arguments after you moved here.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:09.750
Oh yeah, we had our first date near the lakeside over there.

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:10.580
It was the day of the first snow.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.450
We made snowmen...

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:14.620
So you remember?

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.250
...and we had snowfights.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:17.580
And?

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.960
And then I remember...

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:23.590
nothing much after that.

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:29.370
You're right, I guess there wasn't anything after that.

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:39.720
You bastard.

00:21:39.720 --> 00:21:40.730
You cheeky bastard.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:52.620
Thank goodness.

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:53.540
What for?

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:57.640
The Yujin I remember would get angry easily

00:21:57.640 --> 00:21:58.960
and pout a lot,

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:00.920
but she'd laugh a lot too.

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:05.920
But I think you've changed since we last met.

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:11.080
I thought maybe it was because I had made you suffer after we met again.

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:15.390
Promise me you'll keep laughing like you're doing now,

00:22:15.930 --> 00:22:16.890
okay?

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:18.940
Okay.

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:39.160
I know I'm asking for a lot, Director Kim,

00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:41.620
but there's something I need to take care of here,

00:22:41.620 --> 00:22:43.000
so please give me some time.

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:47.460
Thank you.

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:49.510
I cleaned up the place in a hurry since you asked me to,

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:52.430
but how long do you intend to stay?

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:09.490
Thank you.

00:23:09.940 --> 00:23:11.110
Yes, madam.
